<title>USA: TABLE - Conseco Inc raises payout.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Conseco Inc raises payout.</headline>
<dateline>CARMEL, Ind. 1997-07-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarterly</p>
<p>		   Latest		    Prior</p>
<p> Amount		 $0.125		  $0.03125</p>
<p> Pay		     Oct 1</p>
<p> Record		Sept 19</p>
<p>NOTE: Company said it raised the dividend significantly to reflect its increased profitability and to make its dividend yield more comparable with yields of peer companies. Conseco said its board will assess annually the adequacy of its dividend yield in relation to the market value of its shares.</p>
<p>((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
